data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"8dcd3a9b-6c03-4131-b5f9-4bcda0e854e9\", \"excerpt\": \"ArgumentQuo itidem modo et vim necessitatemque fati constituerit et esse tamen in nobis consilii iudiciique nostri arbitrium confirmaverit.\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"833d0cb5-0afe-4727-9dc6-30d4624dc8db\", \"excerpt\": \"FATUM, quod \\u03b5\\u1f31\\u03bc\\u03b1\\u03c1\\u03bc\\u03ad\\u03bd\\u03b7\\u03bd Graeci vocant, ad hanc ferme sententiam Chrysippus, Stoicae princeps philosophiae, definit: Fatum est, inquit, sempiterna quaedam et indeclinabilis series rerum et catena, volvens semetipsa sese et inplicans per aeternos consequentiae ordines, ex quibus apta nexaque est.\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"0b4bfd49-3baf-4638-b8d5-dd52e1b5da79\", \"excerpt\": \"Ipsa autem verba Chrysippi, quantum valui memoria, ascripsi, ut, si cui meum istud interpretamentum videbitur esse obscurius, ad ipsius verba animadvertat.\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"ad59899c-4c0e-4d0b-8825-6ee05e34fb19\", \"excerpt\": \"In libro enim \\u03a0\\u03b5\\u03c1\\u1f76 \\u03a0\\u03c1\\u03bf\\u03bd\\u03bf\\u03af\\u03b1\\u03c2 quarto \\u03b5\\u1f31\\u03bc\\u03b1\\u03c1\\u03bc\\u03ad\\u03bd\\u03b7\\u03bd esse dicit \\u03c6\\u03c5\\u03c3\\u03b9\\u03ba\\u03ae\\u03bd \\u03c4\\u03b9\\u03bd\\u03b1 \\u03c3\\u03cd\\u03bd\\u03c4\\u03b1\\u03be\\u03b9\\u03bd \\u03c4\\u1ff6\\u03bd \\u1f45\\u03bb\\u03c9\\u03bd \\u1f10\\u03be \\u1f00\\u03ca\\u03b4\\u03af\\u03bf\\u03c5 \\u03c4\\u1ff6\\u03bd \\u1f11\\u03c4\\u03ad\\u03c1\\u03c9\\u03bd \\u03c4\\u03bf\\u1fd6\\u03c2 \\u1f11\\u03c4\\u03ad\\u03c1\\u03bf\\u03b9\\u03c2 \\u1f10\\u03c0\\u03b1\\u03ba\\u03bf\\u03bb\\u03bf\\u03c5\\u03b8\\u03bf\\u03cd\\u03bd\\u03c4\\u03c9\\u03bd \\u03ba\\u03b1\\u1f76 \\u03bc\\u03b5\\u03c4\\u03b1\\u03c0\\u03bf\\u03bb\\u03bf\\u03c5\\u03bc\\u03ad\\u03bd\\u03c9\\u03bd \\u1f00\\u03c0\\u03b1\\u03c1\\u03b1\\u03b2\\u03ac\\u03c4\\u03bf\\u03c5 \\u03bf\\u1f54\\u03c3\\u03b7\\u03c2 \\u03c4\\u1fc6\\u03c2 \\u03c4\\u03bf\\u03b9\\u03b1\\u03cd\\u03c4\\u03b7\\u03c2 \\u1f10\\u03c0\\u03b9\\u03c0\\u03bb\\u03bf\\u03ba\\u1fc6\\u03c2.\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"82922e41-b191-48fc-807a-a0b2040f346f\", \"excerpt\": \"Aliarum autem opinionum disciplinarumque auctores huic definitioni ita obstrepunt:\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"bc4585c6-e257-48b4-be22-cf3284dd7604\", \"excerpt\": \"Si Chrysippus, inquiunt, fato putat omnia moveri et regi nec declinari transcendique posse agmina fati et volumina, peccata quoque hominum et delicta non suscensenda neque inducenda sunt ipsis voluntatibusque eorum, sed necessitati cuidam et instantiae, quae oritur ex fato, omnium quae sit rerum domina et arbitra, per quam necesse sit fieri quicquid futurumfiturum est; et propterea nocentium poena\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"e77d7208-5171-43df-9c96-1611f394566d\", \"excerpt\": \"Contra ea Chrysippus tenuiter multa et argute disserit; sed omnium fere quae super ea re scripsit huiuscemodi sententia est:\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"b0efb6ac-9afa-40fc-9f24-d5337ff6350c\", \"excerpt\": \"Quamquam ita sit, inquit, ut ratione quadam necessaria et principali coacta atque conexa sint fato omnia, ingenia tamen ipsa mentium nostrarum proinde sunt fato obnoxia, ut proprietas eorum est ipsa et qualitas.\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"225b105e-3f4e-4ba1-9011-005ac6b62e82\", \"excerpt\": \"Nam si sunt per naturam primitus salubriter utiliterque ficta, omnem illam vim, quae de fato extrinsecus ingruit, inoffensius tractabiliusque transmittunt. Sin vero sunt aspera et inscita et rudia nullisque artium bonarum adminiculis fulta, etiamsi parvo sive nullo fatalis incommodi conflictu urgeantur, sua tamen scaevitate et voluntario impetu in assidua delicta et in errores se ruunt.\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

data: {"type": "answer_chunk", "data": "{\"type\": \"citation_found\", \"passage_id\": \"73cacc51-932f-4af1-85e9-4c4ea2b5c3dc\", \"excerpt\": \"Idque ipsum ut ea ratione fiat, naturalis illa et necessaria rerum consequentia efficit, quae fatum vocatur.\", \"node_ids\": [], \"confidence\": 1.0, \"work_label\": \"Noctes Atticae VII.2 (De Fato et Chrysippo)\"}"}

